{
  "_README": [
    "An EXAMPLE dictionary over an entirely invented cast, so it can ship in public.",
    "Your real one never should: a substitution table is made OF the private data it hides,",
    "so it is the most sensitive file in the pipeline. Keep it outside the repo you publish",
    "(pass --rules with a path elsewhere), or at minimum outside the published subtree.",
    "",
    "The invented company below is 'Sunrise Capital', run by Dave Olsen with a teammate",
    "Marina Belova, an advisor Harold Pike, and a fleet of three machines. Every name,",
    "handle, host, address and number here is fiction; the SHAPES are real, because shape",
    "is what the engine and the gate are about.",
    "",
    "Backslashes: this is JSON, so one backslash in a regex is written as two here, and a",
    "literal backslash in a Windows path is written as four. Getting this wrong is silent -",
    "the rule compiles and simply never matches. See docs/GOTCHAS.md #7."
  ],

  "keep_handles": ["@acme_lab", "@example", "@username", "@handle", "@channel"],

  "secret_literals": {
    "Kq7bus2Xmesh91": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_BUS_TOKEN"
  },

